WEBVTT

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.770
Love is forbidden!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.420
Who is that guy?

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.700
Maybe he's part of Neo-Deava.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:17.540
He looks like a juggler.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:18.620
Or a clown.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.680
What do you mean? Love is forbidden?

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.580
But the wall's finally gone!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.480
Yeah!

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.430
Welcome back, Ms. Chairman.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.520
Chairman?!

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.880
Ms. Chairman, please enjoy these donuts.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.240
Thank you.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.700
This little girl is the chairman?

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.840
Yes.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.790
And that is Neo-Deava's High Commander, Fudo Zen.

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:14.380
The High Commander and the Chairman have been journeying to unravel the mysteries of Aquarion.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:19.360
I suppose their return means they've found something.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:24.890
I'm afraid that I have not been anything about neither these mysteries

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.080
nor the forbidden Aquarion itself.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:31.520
Miss Suomi, do you know the story of Apollon and Silvie?

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.820
Of course.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.640
Everyone knows that fairy tale.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:37.240
I think there was even a movie about it.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.240
It was called <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.200
Correct.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.200
12,000 years ago, after they defeated the Dark Angels,

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.620
Apollon and Silvie were separated.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:54.080
But fierce passions can bring destruction.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.420
Apollon and Silvie were torn from each other and still yearn to meet again.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:03.850
And this causes the modern Aquarion to go berserk.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.550
Berserk?

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:11.110
That's why Neo-Deava sealed away Aquarion's full power.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:14.400
But you already know all about that, don't you, Mister Donar?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.110
Yeah, and I wish I didn't.

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:21.180
But our enemies are growing stronger.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:25.100
We at Neo-Deava are forced to rethink our strategies.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.080
You're right.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.040
We have no choice.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.540
The forbidden powers are all we have.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:36.520
The donut is an empty space surrounded by a ring.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.550
You must eat the empty space at your center,

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.820
Donar Dantes.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.640
Pardon me, Master Jin. Commander Izumo wants to see you.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.780
Wha— A reproduction of Alicia!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.440
Where did you get this?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.860
What does Commander Izumo want?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.610
Yeah?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:07.820
Jin, the data you brought back has been analyzed.

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:13.680
The Machine Angel's parameters depend on its form.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.830
That's what I thought.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:20.480
It fought completely differently before and after its transformation.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.240
One more thing.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.220
When it used that last attack,

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.470
we detected readings consistent with a Rare Igura.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.460
A Rare Igura was in that thing?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.100
Izumo, Kagura's Mithra Gnis has deployed.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.530
That impetuous fool.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.960
Don't tell me he's going to Vega with just his Gnis.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.300
The warp gate is opening!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:45.950
What?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.360
The Mithra Gnis has entered interdimensional space!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:55.290
Who opened the gate?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.460
Did he wake up already?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.900
In short,

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.960
starting today, Holy Angel Academy is a coeducational school.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.490
That means all of you are in the same class.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.750
I know it might take some time to adjust,

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.800
but please try to not let this cause problems.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:45.420
Wow! It's Shrade in the flesh!

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.890
Even the air is polluted...

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.980
Your first assignment together is a social field observation.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.390
You will go out into Neo-Kowloon in mixed teams.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.890
Understood?

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.400
Sounds like a waste of time.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.400
Wow! We're diving right into the good stuff!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:08.580
Mikono...

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:14.860
Ow!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.580
Amata! We're in homeroom!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.330
Stop clowning around!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.040
What is this?

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.210
Please take a handout.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.140
Walk along the promenade...

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:33.380
Bungee jump off the Kowloon Tower...

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.440
Tea time at a hotel with an ocean view?

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:37.280
Isn't this...

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.100
...the standard Neo-Kowloon date plan?

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.100
You'll need these, too.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:45.580
What are these?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.150
They look stupid.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.340
What about mine?

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.920
The chairman has exempted you.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.760
Here are your groups.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.540
Group A: Cierro, Enji, Yoka.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.540
Group B: Malloy, Aika, Mist.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.840
Please give me a cute one, please give me a cute one...

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:05.960
Group C: Andy, Mix, Yunoha.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.550
Who's Yunoha?

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:12.200
You got someone cute like you wanted, didn't you?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.770
She sure is cute.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.550
For a doll! A cat doll, no less!

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:17.970
That's a cat?

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:23.480
I can't believe I'm with such a noisy, annoying boy.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:28.820
Sure, she's fiery, but she's freaking hot!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:33.320
And man, look at those big bangs!

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:38.080
What the hell?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.830
The next group is Shrade, Cayenne, and Sazanka.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.920
Looks like it's us, my friend.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.710
Don't call me that.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.780
But you put my soul at ease.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.380
You have a soul?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.660
You don't mean that.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:57.720
The final group is...

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:00.180
Amata, Mikono, and Zessica.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.580
Uh, hi.

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:13.340
The groups will separate here and go on by themselves.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:16.600
Don't miss the boat back.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:17.580
Understood?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.450
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.480
Many of the Elements are getting electrocuted.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.280
They really are young.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.880
What are these bands?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:59.110
They monitor the Element's vital signs, heart rate, perspiration,

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:02.740
and release an electrical charge if they pass a certain limit.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.750
I think it's cruel!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.000
I can see no purpose to this foolish training!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.400
There is one, though.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:13.840
It's critical for getting the most power out of Aquarion

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:18.430
without reliving the Aquarion Disaster.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.580
The Aquarion Disaster?

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:26.360
Nine years ago, when Aquarion was
deployed to counter the first charge,

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.850
it went berserk during combat.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.800
Two of the Elements went missing in action,

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.820
and the sole survivor, Donar Dantes,

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:37.530
lost both his arms and the woman he loved.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.250
Let me feel them...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.200
The melody of love is ephemeral...

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.880
Mao!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.760
Donar!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:53.680
Aquarion resonates with the emotions of its Elements,

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.520
and amplifies their energy to fight.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:00.490
Its power is directly related to the intensity of those emotions.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:07.960
Do you know what the most intense human emotion is, Miss Suomi?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.840
Hate? Jealousy?

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.660
No.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.960
It's love.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.420
Love?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:19.150
But even in their own minds, they cannot let their feelings actually become love.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:24.800
If they ever find themselves truly in love, Aquarion will go berserk.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:30.180
Just like what happened to Donar and his beloved.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:41.040
But if they can remain at the very edge of love, Aquarion will unleash its vast powers.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:49.140
The relationship between Amata Sora and
Mikono Suzushiro is just short of that border.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.500
That's how they used the forbidden attack.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:57.920
This armband is made to catch and prevent the Elements from developing feelings of love.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.280
Our goal is power just short of the berserk.

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.620
This is special training to pull out of love!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.100
They're right.

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:11.350
I have to keep my students from
suffering the same thing I went through.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.280
Especially Amata.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:16.850
He reminds me of myself when I was young.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.520
That's why I'm here.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.610
It's adorable!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.070
Look, Shush, it's a cat!

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:31.070
Cute?

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:33.580
Mikono is way cuter...

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.500
Ow!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.960
Amata?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.160
What happened?

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.010
My butt!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.510
Don't forget that love is forbidden, Amata.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.520
I can't take my eyes off that kid for a minute.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:10.030
Something smells.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.020
"Observe the people by the poolside of a classy hotel".

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:21.290
And they even bought us these swimsuits.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.300
Not that I don't appreciate it...

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.140
But seriously, what's up with the doll?

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.470
Well, here I am.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.020
Ow...

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:43.160
Huh?

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:48.780
Today's special training is also a simulation of Element groupings.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.540
If the chairman is right,

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:55.740
Mix would make an excellent soldier because boys don't affect her at all.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:56.760
Wrong.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.840
Girls like her completely close themselves off from others.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:03.460
That makes it hard to get them to the edge of love.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:07.460
So why are Shrade, Cayenne, and Sazanka a team?

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.470
They even told us what to order when we went out to eat.

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.300
This is ridiculous.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:16.420
Here is your watermelon juice.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.600
Um, is there only supposed to be one?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.060
That's what was ordered.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:23.980
Well, let's drink.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:24.700
What?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.580
This is part of our training.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.040
We don't have much of a choice.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:32.400
I guess he's shy around girls.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.370
Please excuse him.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.820
Okay...

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:48.210
Shrade and Cayenne drinking juice from the same cup!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.120
There's nothing that can knock Shrade off balance.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.340
Impressive.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.600
But it looks like Sazanka gets her shocks from different things.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:05.140
Miss Chairman, about Shrade's practical combat record...

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.980
I'm aware of his health concerns.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:11.740
Shrade Elan hangs on the very edge of life.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.990
In a way, there's no better place to find feelings on the edge.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.700
How cold.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.040
The combination we have to watch most closely is...

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.790
Amata, Zessica, and Mikono.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:27.710
But Mikono hasn't manifested any Element powers yet!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:34.300
If the ring does not surround anything, a donut is just a lump.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:39.880
Mikono Suzushiro forms the ring where the donut surrounds emptiness.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:41.600
But...

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:44.400
for everything sweet...

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.640
Ow!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:49.480
Are you okay?

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:54.740
Damn. If he keeps at it, there won't be enough blow darts in the world.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:59.620
Amata's heart starts racing when he looks at me.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.240
Oh, Amata.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:04.870
You look happy, Mikono.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.740
Is it 'cause he likes you?

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.120
No way!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.420
You sure?

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:14.550
You know, I like innocent ones like him.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.700
Okay, next is...

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:18.920
Amata!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:20.310
You're with me!

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:21.600
Come on!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.980
Hey, I can make him fly, too!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:31.570
Amata! You'll fly for anyone, won't you?

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:36.280
It's not just anyone. It's me!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.860
Ow!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.100
What's the matter, Shush?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.130
Oh, my god! Who is that?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:55.550
I think he's cool!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.430
Smells good.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.340
Are you all right?

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.230
We can take a break if you want.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.700
Are you still mad about the last fight?

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:21.900
You play with peoples' feelings.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.460
I'm not listening to you.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.020
Please forgive me.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:27.830
My whole life is but being played with.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:31.710
By an Abductor called disease.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.040
Three bungee jumping tickets, please.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.000
I have to do it, too?

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.730
It's training.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.320
You can stay here if you're scared.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.990
We'll just have fun together!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.700
Quit it!

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.100
That's so cool!

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.680
Fine. I know when I'm a third wheel.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:06.620
Enjoy, you two.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.580
Mikono, wait!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.980
Mikono, wait! I—

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.630
You're such a creep, Amata!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.300
You've been flying for Zessica all day!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:23.630
I thought I was the only one...

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:24.990
What was that last thing?

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.060
Go away!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.340
Mikono!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:42.080
A fiery sunset...

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.340
Just like in...

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.960
<i>Skies of Aquaria</i>!

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.560
This song!

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:15.760
Why does this feel so nostalgic?

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:20.880
I met you just a few days ago,

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:24.700
but it feels like it's been a very long time.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.420
It's weird...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.800
I don't think it's weird.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:35.630
I think we were destined to meet.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.350
Are you okay?

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.100
I can't believe I said that!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.800
Forget it! Forget the whole thing!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.720
Do I have to?

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.720
I don't want to forget it!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.480
Mikono...

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.490
This is bad! Mikono's love index is shooting up!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:15.960
Oh, no!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.760
They're almost in love!

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.840
Mister Donar! Stop them!

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.050
Damn it!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:23.050
They're out of dart range!

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.050
Amata!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:37.810
Stop!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.820
Amata, Mikono! Don't do this!

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.820
The scent of forbidden love is as sweet as honey.

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:45.320
But...

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.530
Honey is sure to attract ants...

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.290
Found you.

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:05.040
You stink.

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:11.050
You stink deliciously.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:16.600
Mikono!

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.000
This is...

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.350
It's not love.

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:22.110
This is...

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.360
a forbidden meeting.

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:37.380
Mikono!

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:14.120
Let us talk about seven days from now.

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:18.310
The upcoming <i>scherzando</i> battle will be the <i>dal segno</i> into darkness.

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:20.480
Isn't that right, my friend?

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:24.100
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The Agitato of Life.
